{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24699","headline":"河阳石尚书破回鹘迎贵主过上党射鹭𪆗绘画爲图猥蒙见示称叹不足以诗美 · 白居易","name":"河阳石尚书破回鹘迎贵主过上党射鹭𪆗绘画爲图猥蒙见示称叹不足以诗美","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"塞北虏郊随手破，山东贼垒掉鞭收。\n乌孙公主归秦地，白马将军入潞州。\n劒拔青鳞蛇尾活，弦抨赤羽火星流。\n须知鸟目犹难漏，纵有天狼岂足忧。\n画角三声刁斗晓，清商一部管弦秋。\n他时麟阁图勳业，更合何人居上头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24699.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24699","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}